xudanu – Rust/WASM evolution of Xanadu (Udanax Gold)

This project is derived from and inspired by Udanax Gold (Xanadu 92.1),
originally developed by Autodesk and contributors to the Xanadu project.

The original system introduced novel data structures and algorithms
for generalized hypertext systems.

This implementation:

* Reinterprets and translates those concepts into Rust and WebAssembly
* Includes modifications, optimizations, and new architectural elements

While the core ideas originate from the Xanadu project, this codebase
represents a modern reimplementation and evolution of those concepts.

Original Udanax Gold components remain subject to their original
Xanadu X11 license.

